          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Daniel spent nine years at a bank. The people across his desk were nurses, builders, designers and shop owners, and almost none of them had been shown how to run a household's money. He started drawing the same one page plan for each of them.</p><p>He has taught adults online for six years. Kitty is that page and the eight weeks around it, filmed. This is sample text; replace it with your own story.</p>"
