        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Stock tips make good videos and rarely help on the 20th of the month. The people Daniel taught got stuck in the same places: no idea of their real number, bills on the wrong dates and debts in five apps. The course fixes those first.</p>"
